    <string name="welcome_to_sakina_settings">Welcome to the settings!
        \n\nRemember, if you have any questions, our About page has the answer.</string>
    <string name="rate_us_message">Hi, you won\'t see this message again.
        \n\nIf you\'re finding Sakinah Launcher useful, could you please leave a 5-star review? It\'ll mean the world to us. Thank you!</string>
    <string name="share_message">We need your help! We believe everyone should know about Sakinah Launcher and its benefits, but we can\'t do it alone.
        \n\nCould you please share Sakinah Launcher with your friends, family, and followers? Thank you for your support!</string>
