    <string name="about_title">About Sakinah Launcher</string>
    <string name="about_message">Sakinah Launcher is a calm, minimal launcher with a built-in Muslim Center: prayer times, morning &amp; evening dhikr, and a tasbih counter.\n\nQuick FAQ:\n• Open Settings: long-press the home screen.\n• Lock the screen: double-tap home (enable the accessibility toggle in Settings first).\n• Notes, To-do &amp; Timer: swipe to open the note panel.\n• Hidden apps: long-press an app name in the app list.\n\nMade for focus, not distraction.</string>
    <string name="screen_time">Screen time</string>
    <string name="did_you_know">Did you know?</string>
    <string name="leave_a_review">Leave a review</string>
    <string name="review_message">Sakinah Launcher is free and always will be. It has no ads, collects no data, and reduces your screen time, resulting in a healthier life.
        \n\nWe hope you enjoy it. Tell us what you think.</string>
